# Step 3: VISION — Goal Definition

## Objective
Pin a single-line goal, 3 KPIs, and explicit non-goals.

## Template
```yaml
goal: "{{one_line_goal}}"
kpis:
  - metric: "{{kpi_1_name}}"
    target: "{{kpi_1_target}}"
  - metric: "{{kpi_2_name}}"
    target: "{{kpi_2_target}}"
  - metric: "{{kpi_3_name}}"
    target: "{{kpi_3_target}}"
non_goals:
  - "{{non_goal_1}}"
  - "{{non_goal_2}}"
stack: "{{technology_stack}}"
timeline: "{{estimated_timeline}}"
```
